  "label": "Forced Restraint as a Symbol of Population Control",
  "description": "The meme uses the visual of forced restraint to symbolize a broader, systemic effort to control the population of Black people. This is a metaphorical extension of historical and contemporary racist ideologies that view Black people as needing to be managed or controlled due to perceived overpopulation or biological inferiority.",
